# LOCAL TEST 1 OF 2 (user 2026-11-15: "ok for 1 and 2"): A LARGER CHARGE FOR A FAULT, on the four-town
# policy at 100,000 decisions (cluster job 466519, the best validation checkpoint: 58/80), resumed on Town01.
# = slurm/local_frl_c0actor_privcritic_t01_ar2_keepgoal_nojx_fgx_lc01_miss.env with ONLY the fault charge:
#   a lane crossing, a collision or leaving the road costs 50 once and ends the episode. It was 1 (crossing,
#   collision) and 1 + 1 (off-road: the crossing charge plus EXPLORE_OFF_ROAD_PENALTY, which is now 0 so every
#   fault costs the same 50). Goal mode is paid the explore reward plus +100 on arrival, so both modes change.
# WHY: arriving pays +100 and 200 m of exploring pays +100, a fault cost 1. On Town07 hard (uniform map)
#   60 of 78 failures are a line crossed or the road left outside a junction, and both near-miss episodes
#   cut the last corner at full steering lock 1.2 m and 7 m from the goal. Training went 70-98 m per fault
#   from 25,000 to 190,000 decisions without improving.
# READ: m_per_fault and the deterministic 80-episode validation score of step 125,000 against the 100,000
#   checkpoint it starts from (58/80) and the cluster run's own 150,000 (43/80).
# A resume keeps the learner and starts a fresh replay; the settings below must equal the checkpoint's.
. "$REPO/slurm/local_frl_c0actor_privcritic_t01_ar2_keepgoal_nojx_fgx_lc01_miss.env"
export LANE_DEPARTURE_PENALTY=50 LANE_COLLISION_PENALTY=50 EXPLORE_OFF_ROAD_PENALTY=0
export FRL_REPLAY=300000
export FRL_PARALLEL=1   # only the parallel loop restores a checkpoint; the checkpoint was made by it
